Status: Recovered.

Ritual is GURPS Ritual Magic spellcasting. Prerequisites become skill penalties rather than separately required spells.

“Ritual Magic” names the GURPS spellcasting structure, not a separate Tradition-specific skill. Every Domain that uses the Ritual Engine designates one shared IQ/Very Hard governing skill for all of its Ritual Traditions. Individual Traditions inherit that skill and may not create separate Ritual Magic specialties unless an explicit campaign-wide exception says otherwise.
